OL,3,GNEWSALondon council eyes asylum-row
OL,4,Avillage for homeless
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomeless families on a London council's
OL,7,Fsocial housing waiting list could be
OL,8,Fhoused on an estate in a Shropshire
OL,9,Fvillage that recently fought off plans
OL,10,Fto house asylum seekers.
OL,12,FIn July, plans to house up to 83 asylum
OL,13,Fseekers in new-build homes on Dutton
OL,14,FClose in Stoke Heath were scrapped
OL,15,Ffollowing local opposition.
OL,17,FShropshire Council said it has since
OL,18,Flearnt that Enfield Council was looking
OL,19,Fto rent properties on the estate to
OL,20,Fhomeless families to whom it owes a
OL,21,Fhousing duty.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
