OL,3,GNEWSALondon council eyes asylum-row
OL,4,Avillage for homeless
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it had written to the
OL,7,Fauthority in the capital to "formally
OL,8,Frecord its significant concerns about
OL,9,Fthese proposals". The BBC has
OL,10,Fapproached Enfield Council for a
OL,11,Fresponse.
